{"url":"/enterprise","title":"Analytics Dashboard — Annabel Ruddle","blocks":[{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655168280372-PIDOIZIJFH6ZLW00OU5G/hifif+title.jpg"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655167401070-RXB19HWZN51361153R82/logo.png"},{"type":"heading","level":"H2","text":"Designing an enterprise accounting application for the music industry"},{"type":"p","text":"https://enterprise.hi.fi"},{"type":"heading","level":"H4","text":"Results"},{"type":"p","text":"14+ early sign-ups"},{"type":"p","text":"Secured investment"},{"type":"p","text":"Successful new product launch"},{"type":"heading","level":"H4","text":"Team"},{"type":"p","text":"Annabel - Product Design (Sole)"},{"type":"p","text":"Lennie - Product Manager"},{"type":"p","text":"Rob - Client Services"},{"type":"p","text":"Taylor - Developer"},{"type":"heading","level":"H4","text":"Project Duration"},{"type":"p","text":"10 months"},{"type":"li","text":"3 months - V1 ideation, prototyping, & testing"},{"type":"li","text":"2 months - V1 iterating & design"},{"type":"li","text":"5 months - V1 build & development"},{"type":"heading","level":"H4","text":"Tools"},{"type":"p","text":"Figma"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655502934640-9815IG7U7R3RO8VXXOOR/041.jpg"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655489735364-8EGV0R63M6VDTJY8Z8EW/0-2-2.jpg"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655414905148-JARP2YT9MW6FA2YC2EO2/SkeF.gif-0.0000-2.3400.gif"},{"type":"p","text":"What a business manager feels like after updating a client tracker"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655489116418-CWZLE77NMDN0C6XAO5XZ/side+problem+stats-3.jpg"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655415710348-8Q88BTYVIF6M5Z3K8K4T/Screen+Shot+2022-06-16+at+5.29.18+PM.png"},{"type":"p","text":"Music Services Login Pages"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655495570586-ZK6U5CMFCV3LMWXG6TAX/factor1.jpg"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655416123380-XIO8Z2MZRK2W8KFF4C7W/Screen+Shot+2022-06-16+at+5.48.30+PM.png"},{"type":"p","text":"Business Managers keep track of royalty earnings in a “Client Tracker”"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655495041989-YCV1ZZX3FN2YVURB2OYT/factor2.jpg"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655495092638-7OGCL62HPJM834TCTP5A/factor3.jpg"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655493456209-8Y5BDUGXHMPSBBPK754B/standard+bm+flow.jpg"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655495809959-YW74VYP4FQBGHS8KJFBE/evidence-list.gif-0.0000-1.2000.gif"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655495713070-MLDC8DENTXJGSX09FD2K/factor4.jpg"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655179095677-5RWJD4OQI59XW5RWDS7V/casestudypresentation-May20.006.jpeg"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655498597769-04Q4B3Y57YNLVEUGZRW4/opp+cards.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655498500290-AT2XRFILF8JPOIKTOSRM/limitations.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655425217392-FPKZ4WEDKWEEX549FY7Q/tmp+16.gif"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655416898098-LGQPRXOFZ1PMTBF6SQU0/Screen+Shot+2022-06-16+at+6.01.23+PM.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655180032435-I031JMFXKI3G89FDSV6N/casestudypresentation-May20.008.jpeg"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655500459253-KBVLMJYO73O7LL5HCNL5/048-getting+to+the+solution.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655501792048-S9UB97C26SFRMY9OJAJS/definemopvptitle.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655501775461-0OY9P6ZU8S13CRJSFCW7/defining+the+mvp.png"},{"type":"heading","level":"H4","text":"Trade-offs"},{"type":"p","text":"1. Recoupment Status: tech not there —> so showed Activity date & Statement date separately"},{"type":"p","text":"2. Normalizing Royalties earned in multiple currencies: Tech not there & increase scope, need to store historical exchange rate data. Increase margin of error & liability —> display royalty earned in each currency separately"},{"type":"p","text":"3. Support for multiple types of data vis: increase scope —> 1 main data vis: bar chart"},{"type":"p","text":"4. Self setup: Increase scope, many unknowns, Hifi wanted complete control over who signed up for the beta —> white glove service"},{"type":"p","text":"5. Custom dashboards: Increase scope, tech not there, too complex to do within deadline —> Client Dashboards only with a searchable list of all clients as home"},{"type":"p","text":"6. Notifications: Increase scope, secondary functionality —> scope in for a later version"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655180077768-AY0S6X9EXVF58QFOBHUB/casestudypresentation-May20.009.jpeg"},{"type":"li","text":"The user flows were made in Sketch, and for wireframing & prototyping I moved to Figma as it has more robust prototyping and collaboration capabilities."},{"type":"li","text":"The flows and sitemaps helped to align the team and get stakeholder sign off to move to the next phase: designing the prototype for testing."},{"type":"li","text":"I utilized a lot of user research and some competitive research to guide form factor, narrow focus, and inform my design choices."},{"type":"li","text":"Since testing would be done with real business managers who were not use to seeing wireframes, I decided a rough level of fidelity would be distracting and designed the MVP prototype in high fidelity with lots of interaction. It looked and felt real and got feedback exactly where it was desired: on the core features."},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1641140256172-DI8HBRS48M7S1VSAK66C/evolution-zigzag.jpg"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655502837182-D8TF1KIQHY5FUT9RWY2O/tmp+2.gif-0.0000-4.9000.gif"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655511447403-0E5UVI5FH68I0GRGMONM/068.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1658176544410-R3ZWVGZHIR46HS3A325V/Screen+Recording+2022-07-18+at+4.21.32+PM.gif"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655512029042-9L7MMNPVJUSJ8KWP3MFQ/70.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655511501116-4YI5REP7WQC4WPVV5LRQ/69.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655512070709-7N1LFQ8Y929RJY9XC8NB/71.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1658182997927-2AANFIUPR245ODUK88AW/Screen+Recording+2022-07-18+at+5.53.05+PM.gif"},{"type":"video","src":"/assets/video/7ed39cf8-88c1-47af-a04e-23393b297f9b/video.mp4","poster":"/assets/video/7ed39cf8-88c1-47af-a04e-23393b297f9b/poster.jpg"},{"type":"p","text":"The MVP Enterprise flow from end to end"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1658280137444-Q0EJPFPDAWCE72X2QGBM/Screen+Shot+2022-07-19+at+9.16.16+PM.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1658279732755-SZQ5W53RXEQQ30C2C7YS/Screen+Shot+2022-07-19+at+9.15.07+PM.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655513706547-NJ0GV4S3MORY90V38N2O/Tested+well+and+didnt+and+iterations.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655513801186-UGSOSP92PBWBLR0NG1JA/title-well.png"},{"type":"video","src":"/assets/video/4a4f2c52-d4dd-47eb-ac3e-ca7fcd9380e1/video.mp4","poster":"/assets/video/4a4f2c52-d4dd-47eb-ac3e-ca7fcd9380e1/poster.jpg"},{"type":"p","text":"Interactive Royalty Chart"},{"type":"video","src":"/assets/video/264801dd-aedd-43bb-9c42-efdda2089bdc/video.mp4","poster":"/assets/video/264801dd-aedd-43bb-9c42-efdda2089bdc/poster.jpg"},{"type":"p","text":"Searching & Applying Filters"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655513817491-18CT0NQ5NC5XTNWLWQ4O/title-didnt.png"},{"type":"video","src":"/assets/video/e39c0d05-e676-408a-a9dc-0fa9d037553a/video.mp4","poster":"/assets/video/e39c0d05-e676-408a-a9dc-0fa9d037553a/poster.jpg"},{"type":"p","text":"Multiselect & Batch Downloading Statements"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1655482715541-LWF2UR686U9PCVFJKIRH/whatdidntiteration-currency.gif"},{"type":"p","text":"Changing Currencies"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1658257841372-VRM9OEQEYT6YI9LKTXOO/Screen+Shot+2022-07-19+at+3.09.56+PM.png"},{"type":"video","src":"/assets/video/bb8b5f43-6294-4f7e-927d-e4553dce182f/video.mp4","poster":"/assets/video/bb8b5f43-6294-4f7e-927d-e4553dce182f/poster.jpg"},{"type":"p","text":"Mobile Version"},{"type":"heading","level":"H2","text":"Design for Mobile"},{"type":"heading","level":"H3","text":"Responsive Design"},{"type":"li","text":"Simplified visual experience utilizing sheets, increasing touch targets, and incorporating modern mobile best practices"},{"type":"li","text":"Menu or bar functionality condensed into “Filter” control"},{"type":"heading","level":"H2","text":"Creating The Design System"},{"type":"li","text":"I created the annotated flows & guidelines, styleguide, and component library in Figma. Additionally I included annotated guidelines around transitions and loading animations, and comprehensive statesheets broken out by feature and page."},{"type":"li","text":"Below is a sampling of the system."},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1640723594553-8XAINO5ZXOAP9KV9C247/Screen+Shot+2021-12-28+at+3.31.05+PM.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/c5715195-3467-497f-b630-f6eb68a310f2/Screen+Shot+2021-12-28+at+3.31.52+PM.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/aca97722-a810-4f62-ab9d-6b374d63211d/Screen+Shot+2021-12-28+at+3.37.51+PM.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/6d660386-c27b-426c-9ee7-917b656899ee/Screen+Shot+2021-12-28+at+4.08.44+PM.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/0324872a-025c-453e-af4d-6cc7ddd9d860/All+Statements.jpg"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/4110f1f1-8976-4640-b02c-0bb2f785c5c4/Global+Nav.jpg"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1d8fabb5-68d9-41fe-b6b5-ffc86c235878/Home.jpg"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/26f74004-bab8-4db3-85c2-37a0595e3294/Styles.jpg"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/68faeda3-a345-4f4a-aaad-527252e2b985/Breakpoints.jpg"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1658283163612-5N7RE55DU4XNX0GX25ET/Screen+Shot+2022-07-18+at+4.49.48+PM.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/1658283293248-JVDB2HQLAHSEEPGTQ0VV/Screen+Shot+2022-07-18+at+4.49.59+PM.png"},{"type":"heading","level":"H1","text":"Results"},{"type":"heading","level":"H2","text":"Early Signups & Investment"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/8e79db67-5031-4102-9b88-ea9a123a5f35/69325a26-03bc-496d-8ba6-66939ec2f777.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/973de180-51fc-4b90-ad87-3c9af49db678/b3ff58f5-a46b-44f1-901a-6f1cead94d8e.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/8809022f-4801-4817-a779-374538acf392/2376d98c-bfdf-4bfd-ad8a-16d07fb21bf8.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/b933f90a-5fd7-4ada-a6db-ac7da67fa754/992a7748-028f-42c8-b27d-4ee7b8dba196.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/637ec22e-987e-45af-be99-38ee6f62e784/96936e01-3a5e-4cf9-8405-e759c3557b83.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/e488d58d-5712-4c51-8efa-1db5d7cd99bf/d9e24b2b-b776-4d96-8874-3d6b238b1836-1.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/a3b68630-09e8-4471-9718-19027cd5767e/bebe27db-aaa5-4cb4-831f-721cf25ff6eb-2.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/5c4e2d8c-6b70-49da-a3dc-bd9573672823/45ad5b2a-7ce5-4f5c-aa38-b95412423377-1.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/f8b7ed0b-f039-4f9a-80b7-5fef936538bd/a8a6ba86-4e66-4148-bbc9-5186ba01d5ce-1.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/3fe534ca-dd8c-4da6-82d6-d28d2712d0cd/4d0285c7-053a-4d66-af3b-edad7f0924d0-1.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/d8246cf5-ac9d-488e-a6bc-7d7a7dd0f9e4/0d237206-9fe5-4102-a4d1-8c9fc1cfea96-1.png"}]}
